{
  "format": 1,
  "name": "tn11_03_lot_lists",
  "spec": [
    "traffic-network 4.12",
    "traffic-network 4.13",
    "traffic-network 11.3"
  ],
  "description": "Conformance test 3 (§11) on test 2. L1 at (1,2), 1 x 1: its ring without corners, in boundary order (4.12, TN7), is (1,1), (0,2), (2,2), (1,3); only (1,1) = A has a car record, so its list is [1]. L2 at (2,0): its ring contains (2,1) = B, list [1]. GetMaxTripCapacity gives (5,0,0,0) for L1 and (0,7,0,0) for L2; populations L1 {0x1010: 3}, L2 none; no neighbour connections. So label 1 has capacity (5,7,0,0) and population {0x1010: 3}: AreLotsConnected true; GetConnectedDestinationCount(L1, 1) = 7, (L1, 0) = 5, (L1, 4) = 0, and (L1, -1), (L1, -3), (L1, -4) = 0 (4.13, TN17: FreeCity4 returns 0 for k < 0 where the original reads unrelated words); GetConnectedOccupantCount(L2, 0x1010) = 3; GetOccupantCountForAllSubnetworks(0x1010) = [0, 3]; GetSubnetworksInRectangle(0,0,3,3) = [1]. A lot at (0,3) (ring (0,2), (1,3) plus the clamped cells) has no list: AreLotsConnected with it is false and property 0x2A4F9C74 is removed from it.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "tn_env",
      "cells": [
        4,
        4
      ],
      "tuning": "shipped"
    },
    {
      "op": "tn_init"
    },
    {
      "op": "tn_occupant",
      "id": 1,
      "cell": [
        1,
        1
      ],
      "types": [
        3
      ],
      "turns": [
        2
      ],
      "note": "A: no car connections, turn-around at entry 2"
    },
    {
      "op": "tn_occupant",
      "id": 2,
      "cell": [
        2,
        1
      ],
      "types": [
        3
      ],
      "conns": [
        [
          0,
          2
        ],
        [
          2,
          0
        ]
      ],
      "note": "B: (0 -> 2) and (2 -> 0)"
    },
    {
      "op": "tn_occupant",
      "id": 3,
      "cell": [
        3,
        1
      ],
      "types": [
        3
      ],
      "turns": [
        0
      ],
      "note": "C: turn-around at entry 0"
    },
    {
      "op": "tn_lot",
      "id": 101,
      "rect": [
        1,
        2,
        1,
        2
      ],
      "pops": [
        [
          [
            4112,
            3
          ]
        ]
      ],
      "trip_caps": [
        5,
        0,
        0,
        0
      ],
      "note": "L1"
    },
    {
      "op": "tn_lot",
      "id": 102,
      "rect": [
        2,
        0,
        2,
        0
      ],
      "trip_caps": [
        0,
        7,
        0,
        0
      ],
      "note": "L2"
    },
    {
      "op": "tn_lot",
      "id": 103,
      "rect": [
        0,
        3,
        0,
        3
      ],
      "props": {
        "0x2A4F9C74": {
          "u32": 9
        }
      },
      "note": "L3 at (0,3), with a stale list the pass must remove"
    },
    {
      "op": "tn_call",
      "method": "occupant_changed",
      "args": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "tn_call",
      "method": "occupant_changed",
      "args": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "tn_call",
      "method": "occupant_changed",
      "args": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "tn_call",
      "method": "do_post_city_init"
    },
    {
      "op": "tn_expect_lot",
      "lot": 101,
      "subnetworks": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "tn_expect_lot",
      "lot": 102,
      "subnetworks": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "tn_call",
